<title>FRANCE: Block of 1.1 percent in Pinault traded.</title>
<headline>Block of 1.1 percent in Pinault traded.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A block of 250,000 shares in retailer Pinault-Printemps La Redoute was traded at 2,860 francs per share, traders said,</p>
<p>At 1321 GMT, Pinault was up 0.88 percent at 2,865 francs.</p>
</text>
